(7279068, 1134148, 24073, '<td valign="top">guess I dont need to say great shot, one of my top picks, good luck to you, and btw, great shot.</td>', 'guess I dont need to say great shot, one of my top picks, good luck to you, and btw, great shot.', '2014-11-02 08:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279069, 1133970, 24073, '<td valign="top">You make it really hard to critique when the shot is mere perfection. LOL.  One of my top choices in the challenges, great, great job.</td>', 'You make it really hard to critique when the shot is mere perfection. LOL.  One of my top choices in the challenges, great, great job.', '2014-11-02 08:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279070, 1134047, 24073, '<td valign="top">great job, I love the colors, and candid nature of the shot, it seems very natural, and gives a great warm theme.  There is a little bit of a graduating of colors issue on my screen from the sun on the sky, I would imagine its from having the water, and rocks in such clear, crisp focus.  At any rate the shot comes to me as one of the best in the challenge, of course, I''m sort of a mush when it comes to love stories. LOL.</td>', 'great job, I love the colors, and candid nature of the shot, it seems very natural, and gives a great warm theme.  There is a little bit of a graduating of colors issue on my screen from the sun on the sky, I would imagine its from having the water, and rocks in such clear, crisp focus.  At any rate the shot comes to me as one of the best in the challenge, of course, I''m sort of a mush when it comes to love stories. LOL.', '2014-11-02 08:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279071, 1133659, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well damn, can''t critique that which is done in perfection. LOL.  I want to, I want to really bad, but the only thing I can see worth even mentioning is the newer amtrak type train in the background, and I wouldn''t of noticed that had I not been hell bent on finding something wrong with the photo.  Great colors, great composition, great post process technique, very demanding shot,  by that I mean it really pops out, and draws your attention.  Great job, one of my top choices in the challenge.</td>', 'Well damn, can''t critique that which is done in perfection. LOL.  I want to, I want to really bad, but the only thing I can see worth even mentioning is the newer amtrak type train in the background, and I wouldn''t of noticed that had I not been hell bent on finding something wrong with the photo.  Great colors, great composition, great post process technique, very demanding shot,  by that I mean it really pops out, and draws your attention.  Great job, one of my top choices in the challenge.', '2014-11-02 08:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279072, 1131908, 24073, '<td valign="top">So then their is the folks out there that just make the rest of us look amateur. LOL.  Great timing, great colors, great post process technique, and great composition.  One of my top choices, good luck.</td>', 'So then their is the folks out there that just make the rest of us look amateur. LOL.  Great timing, great colors, great post process technique, and great composition.  One of my top choices, good luck.', '2014-11-02 08:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279073, 1133748, 24073, '<td valign="top">Its an amazing shot, probably don''t need to say that, but what I really love about this shot, and what takes it over the top of my other choices in the challenge, is how strait "out of the camera" it looks.  Does not inherit a post processing feel to it, and the colors, and overall composition make it very demanding to look at.  Its one of my top choices, if not, my number one.  Thank you for submitting, and good luck.</td>', 'Its an amazing shot, probably don''t need to say that, but what I really love about this shot, and what takes it over the top of my other choices in the challenge, is how strait "out of the camera" it looks.  Does not inherit a post processing feel to it, and the colors, and overall composition make it very demanding to look at.  Its one of my top choices, if not, my number one.  Thank you for submitting, and good luck.', '2014-11-02 08:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279075, 1133855, 24073, '<td valign="top">So for me here is the blunt of my critique.  Prepare...LOL.  How the hell are we supposed to compete with this. LOL.  Great image, and one I can seriously not find anything to critique.  The image is beautiful, and the light is magical.  I would of loved to have been there, I hope you took time to absorb the moment, and appreciate gods good grace.  Good luck.  One of my top choices.</td>', 'So for me here is the blunt of my critique.  Prepare...LOL.  How the hell are we supposed to compete with this. LOL.  Great image, and one I can seriously not find anything to critique.  The image is beautiful, and the light is magical.  I would of loved to have been there, I hope you took time to absorb the moment, and appreciate gods good grace.  Good luck.  One of my top choices.', '2014-11-02 08:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279077, 1134147, 135629, '<td valign="top">This must be the post-countdown...1....2....3!!!! FINE, YOU ARE GETTING ON THE TRAIN LIKE IT OR NOT!!!<br/>We have all been that child. <br/>Great capture!</td>', 'This must be the post-countdown...1....2....3!!!! FINE, YOU ARE GETTING ON THE TRAIN LIKE IT OR NOT!!!We have all been that child. Great capture!', '2014-11-02 08:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279078, 1133967, 135629, '<td valign="top">Well executed!</td>', 'Well executed!', '2014-11-02 08:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279079, 1134142, 135629, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting things going on here, love it.</td>', 'Lots of interesting things going on here, love it.', '2014-11-02 08:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279080, 1134113, 24073, '<td valign="top">My critique capabilities fall short, so I can just give my compliments.  I certainly love the composition, and the choice to take the color out.  It makes the shot much more demanding to look at, and greater historic relevence to ponder.  If there is one thing I can say about it in critique, which by the way is desperate in grasping at something, it would be that it isn''t as engaging as perhaps it could be.  Not a story that I can ponder in its wake.  If there was a farm truck, or wedding, or somebody just simply on the stairs I could build a story that fits into my psyche.  But like I said I''m not sure that would make the shot better or worse, beings I''m amateur, and looking at this shot it is way above my pay grade so to say.  LOL, great shot, one of my top choices.</td>', 'My critique capabilities fall short, so I can just give my compliments.  I certainly love the composition, and the choice to take the color out.  It makes the shot much more demanding to look at, and greater historic relevence to ponder.  If there is one thing I can say about it in critique, which by the way is desperate in grasping at something, it would be that it isn''t as engaging as perhaps it could be.  Not a story that I can ponder in its wake.  If there was a farm truck, or wedding, or somebody just simply on the stairs I could build a story that fits into my psyche.  But like I said I''m not sure that would make the shot better or worse, beings I''m amateur, and looking at this shot it is way above my pay grade so to say.  LOL, great shot, one of my top choices.', '2014-11-02 08:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279081, 1134163, 135629, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photo, great light, minimal pp (visible) a refreshing vision after viewing about a hundred super over-processed images.</td>', 'Fantastic photo, great light, minimal pp (visible) a refreshing vision after viewing about a hundred super over-processed images.', '2014-11-02 08:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279082, 1133970, 135629, '<td valign="top">Love the northern lights shots, nice work.</td>', 'Love the northern lights shots, nice work.', '2014-11-02 08:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279083, 1133789, 135629, '<td valign="top">Razor sharp, thirds, nice soft lighting on the front of the car. Great shot.</td>', 'Razor sharp, thirds, nice soft lighting on the front of the car. Great shot.', '2014-11-02 08:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279084, 1132187, 24073, '<td valign="top">Simply gratifying to the eyes.  The blur in the middle of the screen may distract from the overall image, namely because of the blur at the edges of the ice.  However it doesn''t take away enough for me not say, one of my top choices in the challenge, and a great image to frame.  good luck</td>', 'Simply gratifying to the eyes.  The blur in the middle of the screen may distract from the overall image, namely because of the blur at the edges of the ice.  However it doesn''t take away enough for me not say, one of my top choices in the challenge, and a great image to frame.  good luck', '2014-11-02 08:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279085, 1133939, 135629, '<td valign="top">Lots going on here, really interesting &amp; daring double... or perhaps triple exposure entry. Good luck!</td>', 'Lots going on here, really interesting & daring double... or perhaps triple exposure entry. Good luck!', '2014-11-02 08:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279086, 1133377, 135629, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, caught my eye and held it - the circular framing of the subject through the heli-door is very interesting. Good luck!</td>', 'Cool shot, caught my eye and held it - the circular framing of the subject through the heli-door is very interesting. Good luck!', '2014-11-02 08:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279087, 1134096, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well you did a good one here thats for sure.  Your model has a huge impression on my eye.  His posture, his glare, glasses, and exposure are very exquisite.  Rather you did that, or the model, my compliments abound.  The lighting is fabulous, great job.  One of my top choices for the challenge.</td>', 'Well you did a good one here thats for sure.  Your model has a huge impression on my eye.  His posture, his glare, glasses, and exposure are very exquisite.  Rather you did that, or the model, my compliments abound.  The lighting is fabulous, great job.  One of my top choices for the challenge.', '2014-11-02 08:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279088, 1133934, 135629, '<td valign="top">A very pleasant shot, refreshingly void of over-processing.</td>', 'A very pleasant shot, refreshingly void of over-processing.', '2014-11-02 08:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279089, 1133891, 24073, '<td valign="top">See now I''m a sucker for horses, you hit my weak spot.  More than that though the technique is exquisite.  The bokeh in the front, and colors are awesome, I''d love to have been there.  Beautiful-9.</td>', 'See now I''m a sucker for horses, you hit my weak spot.  More than that though the technique is exquisite.  The bokeh in the front, and colors are awesome, I''d love to have been there.  Beautiful-9.', '2014-11-02 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279090, 1133742, 24073, '<td valign="top">A ridiculously well done shot, I''d love to kick your camera down that hillside right now. LOL, I''m kidding, of course.  One of my top choices in the challenge.  My expressed compliments for the composition.</td>', 'A ridiculously well done shot, I''d love to kick your camera down that hillside right now. LOL, I''m kidding, of course.  One of my top choices in the challenge.  My expressed compliments for the composition.', '2014-11-02 08:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279091, 1133011, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well done, hats off to the composition.  Very demanding to look at, and my guess is, that the views to this image will go off the charts.  Great job.</td>', 'Well done, hats off to the composition.  Very demanding to look at, and my guess is, that the views to this image will go off the charts.  Great job.', '2014-11-02 08:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279092, 1132728, 24073, '<td valign="top">Get back in your cage.  Geez, what an extraordinary shot.  There is absolutely nobody in this world that could critique this shot, it has simply been done to perfection.  My instincts tell me that you have some experience with this bridge, and that this shot was not luck in any way.  Of course, I''m wrong a great deal of my time, but if you got this in luck, which I know is not the case, you need to buy some lottery tickets. LOL.  I''m bumping this up to my top choice in the challenge, and as I have already said, back to the cage, your making us all look bad. LOL.  Love it, thank you.  Good luck.</td>', 'Get back in your cage.  Geez, what an extraordinary shot.  There is absolutely nobody in this world that could critique this shot, it has simply been done to perfection.  My instincts tell me that you have some experience with this bridge, and that this shot was not luck in any way.  Of course, I''m wrong a great deal of my time, but if you got this in luck, which I know is not the case, you need to buy some lottery tickets. LOL.  I''m bumping this up to my top choice in the challenge, and as I have already said, back to the cage, your making us all look bad. LOL.  Love it, thank you.  Good luck.', '2014-11-02 08:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279093, 1133697, 24073, '<td valign="top">There is a great deal to say about how much I love this shot, but I won''t because as photographers, and artist, we don''t need the big head to get in the way of our shots. LOL.  Some stiff competition out there, good luck.</td>', 'There is a great deal to say about how much I love this shot, but I won''t because as photographers, and artist, we don''t need the big head to get in the way of our shots. LOL.  Some stiff competition out there, good luck.', '2014-11-02 08:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279094, 1133666, 24073, '<td valign="top">The colors are just wonderful, and the blue way back on the ocean drive me into a place of graceful wonder, and of course envy. LOL.  I want a romantic dream within this photo, and it makes me crazy being in the mid-west, and not being able to part of this work of god. Beautiful job, and great execution.</td>', 'The colors are just wonderful, and the blue way back on the ocean drive me into a place of graceful wonder, and of course envy. LOL.  I want a romantic dream within this photo, and it makes me crazy being in the mid-west, and not being able to part of this work of god. Beautiful job, and great execution.', '2014-11-02 08:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279095, 1133521, 24073, '<td valign="top">So a very fitting photo for the month were in, of course.  The execution on your part is well done, the light, colors, and subject, are beautifully composed.  A great halloween photo, and now all you have to worry about is the stiff competition on the other side of a challenge not detailed for halloween.  Could easily be a number one in a halloween contest.</td>', 'So a very fitting photo for the month were in, of course.  The execution on your part is well done, the light, colors, and subject, are beautifully composed.  A great halloween photo, and now all you have to worry about is the stiff competition on the other side of a challenge not detailed for halloween.  Could easily be a number one in a halloween contest.', '2014-11-02 08:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279096, 1134117, 24073, '<td valign="top">Owe my...so serene!  Very romantic, and for country enthusiasts like me, one of a kind.  I would frame this in my house in a New York second.  Gorgeous everything from, the colors, to the subject, and everything in between.  Great execution.  One of my top choices in the challenge.</td>', 'Owe my...so serene!  Very romantic, and for country enthusiasts like me, one of a kind.  I would frame this in my house in a New York second.  Gorgeous everything from, the colors, to the subject, and everything in between.  Great execution.  One of my top choices in the challenge.', '2014-11-02 09:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279097, 1134200, 24073, '<td valign="top">My only critique is that I''m not a city dweller, and of course, I can not take away from the shot for preference of such.  The truth is that you have scored one heck of a shot, and you made it worth the time it took to get it.  The lights, and sharp lines are very profound, but taking a second look you notice the hills, and sunlight in the background, all of which lend this photo an expounding force in the challenge.  Do I have to mention the colors?  They are amazing, and not even being the city type it is one of my top choices in this challenge, and makes me want to go be part of the buzz.  Love it.  great job.</td>', 'My only critique is that I''m not a city dweller, and of course, I can not take away from the shot for preference of such.  The truth is that you have scored one heck of a shot, and you made it worth the time it took to get it.  The lights, and sharp lines are very profound, but taking a second look you notice the hills, and sunlight in the background, all of which lend this photo an expounding force in the challenge.  Do I have to mention the colors?  They are amazing, and not even being the city type it is one of my top choices in this challenge, and makes me want to go be part of the buzz.  Love it.  great job.', '2014-11-02 09:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279100, 1133370, 24073, '<td valign="top">So many great poems can go on this photo, inspirational verses, or scripture and the like.  But here is why I say this...I''m not a professional, I''m on the outskirts of the art, but when I see this shot the first thing that pops into my head, is poetry.  I like to think this shot in itself is poetry, and not just poetry, but the warm graceful kind of poetry, which is exactly the kind I subscribe to.  Nature, and life.  Beauty, and cycles, you have simply caught it in photo form, which some great skill to posses. A top choice for sure.  Good luck with the stiff competition that is out there.</td>', 'So many great poems can go on this photo, inspirational verses, or scripture and the like.  But here is why I say this...I''m not a professional, I''m on the outskirts of the art, but when I see this shot the first thing that pops into my head, is poetry.  I like to think this shot in itself is poetry, and not just poetry, but the warm graceful kind of poetry, which is exactly the kind I subscribe to.  Nature, and life.  Beauty, and cycles, you have simply caught it in photo form, which some great skill to posses. A top choice for sure.  Good luck with the stiff competition that is out there.', '2014-11-02 09:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279102, 1134225, 24073, '<td valign="top">Well if anybody trying to say this isn''t an easy 8, they are insane.  LOL, probably me, but I just don''t see the critique that I can help with, a magnificent execution of a gorgeous skyline.  There is stiff competition out there this round so good luck.</td>', 'Well if anybody trying to say this isn''t an easy 8, they are insane.  LOL, probably me, but I just don''t see the critique that I can help with, a magnificent execution of a gorgeous skyline.  There is stiff competition out there this round so good luck.', '2014-11-02 09:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279107, 1133965, 24073, '<td valign="top">Here is a quick idea of what I''m seeing.  I don''t know what distance I''m seeing this shot at.  The sky is the only thing I have to reference this by, and we all know that can be decieving at times.  I don''t know if this is four inches high, or four miles high, or from plane, or from twelve inches off the ground.  No mind it doesn''t take away from the photo, actually for me it draws my interest into the photo instead.  I''m in love with it, great job, and one of my top choices.</td>', 'Here is a quick idea of what I''m seeing.  I don''t know what distance I''m seeing this shot at.  The sky is the only thing I have to reference this by, and we all know that can be decieving at times.  I don''t know if this is four inches high, or four miles high, or from plane, or from twelve inches off the ground.  No mind it doesn''t take away from the photo, actually for me it draws my interest into the photo instead.  I''m in love with it, great job, and one of my top choices.', '2014-11-02 09:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279109, 1133665, 24073, '<td valign="top">So it seems so expert.  I can''t believe that this is a 2014 shot, noway!  Your intentions are well executed, and this photo lends a high grade to the photographer skill set, more than the photo itself.  With that in mind, I''m not sure it wins the challenge, but it certainly wins my envy, and respect.  Amazing execution.</td>', 'So it seems so expert.  I can''t believe that this is a 2014 shot, noway!  Your intentions are well executed, and this photo lends a high grade to the photographer skill set, more than the photo itself.  With that in mind, I''m not sure it wins the challenge, but it certainly wins my envy, and respect.  Amazing execution.', '2014-11-02 09:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279122, 1134264, 118154, '<td valign="top">Has a moment well caught.7.</td>', 'Has a moment well caught.7.', '2014-11-02 09:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
