(7279499, 1133832, 30364, '<td valign="top">Put this ambiguous stuff before me and I stay happy for ages.  Interesting photograph.  Thank you.</td>', 'Put this ambiguous stuff before me and I stay happy for ages.  Interesting photograph.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279500, 1134110, 30364, '<td valign="top">Terrific, dynamic photograph.  I think verisimilitude is the right word.  Thank you.</td>', 'Terrific, dynamic photograph.  I think verisimilitude is the right word.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279503, 1134204, 30364, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like bug macros, which makes this doubly impressive for me because it''s quite fabulous.  Congratulations on making something beautiful and interesting out of what is normally a tedious genre.   Way better and more interesting than the usual buggers.  Thank you.</td>', 'I really don''t like bug macros, which makes this doubly impressive for me because it''s quite fabulous.  Congratulations on making something beautiful and interesting out of what is normally a tedious genre.   Way better and more interesting than the usual buggers.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279505, 1133531, 30364, '<td valign="top">I buy this stuff every time.  Never tire of the challenge to the imagination.  Thank you.</td>', 'I buy this stuff every time.  Never tire of the challenge to the imagination.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279507, 1133377, 30364, '<td valign="top">Fifi''s a B29 if my memory''s accurate.  But I never saw a B29 shot as interesting as this.  It''s terrific.  Thank you.</td>', 'Fifi''s a B29 if my memory''s accurate.  But I never saw a B29 shot as interesting as this.  It''s terrific.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279511, 1133368, 30364, '<td valign="top">Love the photo, but remain sceptical of the attribution.  But the picture is certainly inspirational, if not necessarily miraculous.  Thank you.</td>', 'Love the photo, but remain sceptical of the attribution.  But the picture is certainly inspirational, if not necessarily miraculous.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279517, 1134216, 30364, '<td valign="top">I was about to bang down a 5 and move on ... but wait ...this is much more substantial than the average amateur glamour shot.  More substantial too than a well-<i>above</i>-average amateur glamour shot. It''s effortless enough, and without any jarring note, that I think it''s a professional''s work.  Pretty darn nice it is too.  Thank you.</td>', 'I was about to bang down a 5 and move on ... but wait ...this is much more substantial than the average amateur glamour shot.  More substantial too than a well-above-average amateur glamour shot. It''s effortless enough, and without any jarring note, that I think it''s a professional''s work.  Pretty darn nice it is too.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279522, 1134213, 30364, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Havana, I suppose?  The hand dangling from the window elevates it beyond the ordinary.  Thank you.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Havana, I suppose?  The hand dangling from the window elevates it beyond the ordinary.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279528, 1134167, 30364, '<td valign="top">Good Grief!  He could BE Ned Kelly!  The resemblance goes beyond the beard.  And your terrific photography is the clincher.  Thank you ... Such is life.</td>', 'Good Grief!  He could BE Ned Kelly!  The resemblance goes beyond the beard.  And your terrific photography is the clincher.  Thank you ... Such is life.', '2014-11-03 09:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279530, 1132506, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful!  I hope it''s really a selfie, and even if it''s not I am going to go on believing that it is.  Because I want to.<br/>Thank you.</td>', 'This is wonderful!  I hope it''s really a selfie, and even if it''s not I am going to go on believing that it is.  Because I want to.Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279538, 1134271, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautifully conceived and executed.  Tibi?  Thank you.</td>', 'Beautifully conceived and executed.  Tibi?  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 09:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279563, 1134068, 30364, '<td valign="top">Must be Melbourne?  Well you found exactly the right, and  only, point of view to animate the scene, thereby elevating the street art to your own.  Thank you.</td>', 'Must be Melbourne?  Well you found exactly the right, and  only, point of view to animate the scene, thereby elevating the street art to your own.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 10:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279564, 1132313, 30364, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  Perfect judgement between what is said and what is unsaid ... You''ve stirred in exactly enough of both, I think.  Thank you.</td>', 'Lovely.  Perfect judgement between what is said and what is unsaid ... You''ve stirred in exactly enough of both, I think.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 10:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279574, 1134117, 30669, '<td valign="top">A wonderful shot. Like a painting. Love the lighting and the knurly tree with all those roots contrasts very nicely with the straight background trees. 10</td>', 'A wonderful shot. Like a painting. Love the lighting and the knurly tree with all those roots contrasts very nicely with the straight background trees. 10', '2014-11-03 10:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279583, 1134264, 124815, '<td valign="top">marvelous<br/>bump<br/>Very interesting how some photographs look more poignant when they are smaller or, by the same token, if they are big but the viewer has space to see them from a distance.<br/>A 10 is all I can give it</td>', 'marvelousbumpVery interesting how some photographs look more poignant when they are smaller or, by the same token, if they are big but the viewer has space to see them from a distance.A 10 is all I can give it', '2014-11-03 11:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279585, 1134204, 124815, '<td valign="top">You got that right! Fabulous!<br/>bump<br/>Am back to this image. Such a reassuring feeling of the presence of the miraculous.<br/>and again...</td>', 'You got that right! Fabulous!bumpAm back to this image. Such a reassuring feeling of the presence of the miraculous.and again...', '2014-11-03 11:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279592, 1134163, 135744, '<td valign="top">Ok I will give up all attempts at photographing deer as I will never in a million years take a shot this good. This is superb. Please tell me it was taken in a wildlife park or you have a monster lens. Even if both of these are true it one superb photo. Well done. I am green with envy:)</td>', 'Ok I will give up all attempts at photographing deer as I will never in a million years take a shot this good. This is superb. Please tell me it was taken in a wildlife park or you have a monster lens. Even if both of these are true it one superb photo. Well done. I am green with envy:)', '2014-11-03 12:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279620, 1134264, 30364, '<td valign="top">Brilliant.  Instructive because it bends several rules to great effect.  The result is an unfamiliar photograph, and in this day and age that''s so rare as to be worth a trumpet fanfare.  Thank you.</td>', 'Brilliant.  Instructive because it bends several rules to great effect.  The result is an unfamiliar photograph, and in this day and age that''s so rare as to be worth a trumpet fanfare.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 13:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279621, 1134025, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a super-duper photograph.  The lighting is just astonishing, and yet the immediate impression is to not even think about the lighting at all, which just goes to show how very good it is.  <br/> <br/>The car is 90% implied, the road is there but hardly so, the instrument console visible just enough to show you care , the fluffy dice are in motion ... and you (I''m assuming that''s you) are locked in the motor-head zone ... plus just enough highlights from the windscreen frame, the mirror and the driver''s knuckles.  The reflected light on the face is perfect and looks 100% natural, though I suspect you''ve helped it out somehow?<br/> <br/>This is a sensationally good photograph because it doesn''t impose itself on the iconography.  I''d happily throw this baby a double-six all day long, but alas I''m limited to 10, so please have that with my compliments.  Plus an Order of the Thumb.  Thank you!<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is a super-duper photograph.  The lighting is just astonishing, and yet the immediate impression is to not even think about the lighting at all, which just goes to show how very good it is.   The car is 90% implied, the road is there but hardly so, the instrument console visible just enough to show you care , the fluffy dice are in motion ... and you (I''m assuming that''s you) are locked in the motor-head zone ... plus just enough highlights from the windscreen frame, the mirror and the driver''s knuckles.  The reflected light on the face is perfect and looks 100% natural, though I suspect you''ve helped it out somehow? This is a sensationally good photograph because it doesn''t impose itself on the iconography.  I''d happily throw this baby a double-six all day long, but alas I''m limited to 10, so please have that with my compliments.  Plus an Order of the Thumb.  Thank you!', '2014-11-03 13:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279624, 1133227, 30364, '<td valign="top">One of the most beautiful photographs I''ve seen for ages.  It''s love of the photograph, it''s understanding of the photograph as an object, is magnificent.  I hope it gets the exposure that it deserves.  Alas, I don''t suppose it will.  And this won''t help much either ... an emphatic 10 and the mixed blessing of an Order of the Thumb.  So sorry!  But thank you.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'One of the most beautiful photographs I''ve seen for ages.  It''s love of the photograph, it''s understanding of the photograph as an object, is magnificent.  I hope it gets the exposure that it deserves.  Alas, I don''t suppose it will.  And this won''t help much either ... an emphatic 10 and the mixed blessing of an Order of the Thumb.  So sorry!  But thank you.', '2014-11-03 13:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279627, 1133200, 30364, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful.  It''s so different, so unexpected.  I''m not entirely sure what it might mean, but I do know what it represents, what it stands for ... a splendid tilt at the conventional follow-my-leader numb-nut mediocrity of contemporary digital photography.  If I could give you the Don Quixote award I would do so, but all I have in the shop is this dusty old Order of the Thumb.  Plus a 10 and a Muchas Gracias.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=800078" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_800078.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Just wonderful.  It''s so different, so unexpected.  I''m not entirely sure what it might mean, but I do know what it represents, what it stands for ... a splendid tilt at the conventional follow-my-leader numb-nut mediocrity of contemporary digital photography.  If I could give you the Don Quixote award I would do so, but all I have in the shop is this dusty old Order of the Thumb.  Plus a 10 and a Muchas Gracias.', '2014-11-03 13:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279630, 1133789, 30364, '<td valign="top">I''m a pushover for custom car shots, especially when they liberate the soulful creature within the ride.  Thank you.</td>', 'I''m a pushover for custom car shots, especially when they liberate the soulful creature within the ride.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 13:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7279631, 1134274, 30364, '<td valign="top">Best wave photograph I''ve ever seen.  Most of the also-rans in this genre were all about improbable colour and unrealistic detail.  Yours is about impressionism.  Movement. Sound. The ocean as a heaving creature.  Which is what she is.  Thank you.</td>', 'Best wave photograph I''ve ever seen.  Most of the also-rans in this genre were all about improbable colour and unrealistic detail.  Yours is about impressionism.  Movement. Sound. The ocean as a heaving creature.  Which is what she is.  Thank you.', '2014-11-03 13:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
