(7280632, 1133665, 13077, '<td valign="top">The lady on the left couldn''t care less. lol<br/>I like the old fashioned processing on this, and how nothing new is in the scene.</td>', 'The lady on the left couldn''t care less. lolI like the old fashioned processing on this, and how nothing new is in the scene.', '2014-11-05 20:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
