(7280647, 1134151, 13077, '<td valign="top">Nice moment, and very cool looking bird. The photo looks a bit soft though, maybe the focus was slightly off or maybe motion blur?</td>', 'Nice moment, and very cool looking bird. The photo looks a bit soft though, maybe the focus was slightly off or maybe motion blur?', '2014-11-05 20:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
