(7280824, 1133058, 156466, '<td valign="top">I like the scene but not the processing.  My eye is constantly pulled away from the subject.</td>', 'I like the scene but not the processing.  My eye is constantly pulled away from the subject.', '2014-11-06 05:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280825, 1134225, 156466, '<td valign="top">An ND to allow a longer exposure here to blur the water and perhaps the clouds would have been gorgeous here (unless those lights changed color).  Love the lights but not the water texture.  7</td>', 'An ND to allow a longer exposure here to blur the water and perhaps the clouds would have been gorgeous here (unless those lights changed color).  Love the lights but not the water texture.  7', '2014-11-06 05:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280826, 1133745, 156466, '<td valign="top">I wish that path didn''t disappear.  Lovely scene and great light.  Love how you preserved the leaf texture within the bounds of this contrasty scene.  HDR?  If so, it was done right.  8.</td>', 'I wish that path didn''t disappear.  Lovely scene and great light.  Love how you preserved the leaf texture within the bounds of this contrasty scene.  HDR?  If so, it was done right.  8.', '2014-11-06 05:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280828, 1133965, 156466, '<td valign="top">Sublime?  Yes, indeed it is.</td>', 'Sublime?  Yes, indeed it is.', '2014-11-06 05:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280830, 1134111, 156466, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot.  Slight off-center camera position bothers me a bit, and a little too high key for my tastes throughout.  Great lines and subject.  7</td>', 'Lovely shot.  Slight off-center camera position bothers me a bit, and a little too high key for my tastes throughout.  Great lines and subject.  7', '2014-11-06 05:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280831, 1133818, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great sky and subject but the extra lines are distracting.  Perhaps a tighter crop and some judicious use of cloning?  Sky is a little over structured for my taste as well.</td>', 'Great sky and subject but the extra lines are distracting.  Perhaps a tighter crop and some judicious use of cloning?  Sky is a little over structured for my taste as well.', '2014-11-06 05:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280832, 1134148, 156466, '<td valign="top">Well scene and captured.</td>', 'Well scene and captured.', '2014-11-06 05:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280835, 1131838, 156466, '<td valign="top">I wish you had managed to get those geese to stand out a little more.  Nice capture.</td>', 'I wish you had managed to get those geese to stand out a little more.  Nice capture.', '2014-11-06 05:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280837, 1133789, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great lines and angle with the car.  Perhaps a little too much negative space?</td>', 'Great lines and angle with the car.  Perhaps a little too much negative space?', '2014-11-06 05:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280838, 1134115, 156466, '<td valign="top">Giving you an extra point for using "Crepuscular" in the title.</td>', 'Giving you an extra point for using "Crepuscular" in the title.', '2014-11-06 06:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280840, 1134058, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of "Once Upon A Time". ;)</td>', 'Not a big fan of "Once Upon A Time". ;)', '2014-11-06 06:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280842, 1134110, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Batman angle doesn''t do much for it for me, other than having me waiting for the truck to fall over.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Batman angle doesn''t do much for it for me, other than having me waiting for the truck to fall over.', '2014-11-06 06:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280843, 1133744, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting - the clouds over the cliffs in the background almost give it a tsunami look.</td>', 'Interesting - the clouds over the cliffs in the background almost give it a tsunami look.', '2014-11-06 06:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280846, 1133970, 156466, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous.  I''d easily give this 10 if the slight skewing of the center line didn''t bother me so much.  I want it not to, and I can see that you are indeed over the center of some type of rail, but that initial gab is more distracting than anything else. So it''s a 9 instead.  Folks up north have such an unfair advantage in these challenges. ;)</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous.  I''d easily give this 10 if the slight skewing of the center line didn''t bother me so much.  I want it not to, and I can see that you are indeed over the center of some type of rail, but that initial gab is more distracting than anything else. So it''s a 9 instead.  Folks up north have such an unfair advantage in these challenges. ;)', '2014-11-06 06:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280847, 1134152, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting character.  A little overly contrasty for me.</td>', 'Interesting character.  A little overly contrasty for me.', '2014-11-06 06:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280849, 1134213, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting scene.  I like the folks in the background (though the stray arm is distracting) and the implication that they might be purposefully ignored by the officer.  At first I wasn''t sure about the composition or crop, but the longer I look at it the more I appreciate it.  8</td>', 'Interesting scene.  I like the folks in the background (though the stray arm is distracting) and the implication that they might be purposefully ignored by the officer.  At first I wasn''t sure about the composition or crop, but the longer I look at it the more I appreciate it.  8', '2014-11-06 06:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280850, 1132186, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice panning shot.  Runway line and windsock pole are a little askew.</td>', 'Nice panning shot.  Runway line and windsock pole are a little askew.', '2014-11-06 06:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280851, 1134047, 156466, '<td valign="top">I find myself wanting this otherwise lovely capture to be a little wider, and for the horizon line to be dead-straight. 7</td>', 'I find myself wanting this otherwise lovely capture to be a little wider, and for the horizon line to be dead-straight. 7', '2014-11-06 06:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280852, 1133398, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture.  If the trails are limited because of the 10 frame limit I hope you shot more and made them longer.  Stunning light and perfectly composed.  10</td>', 'Really nice capture.  If the trails are limited because of the 10 frame limit I hope you shot more and made them longer.  Stunning light and perfectly composed.  10', '2014-11-06 06:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280853, 1134068, 156466, '<td valign="top">Don''t know why, but he made me chuckle.</td>', 'Don''t know why, but he made me chuckle.', '2014-11-06 06:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280854, 1133856, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great use of light and reflection.  Wish you did a touch of perspective correction (or a little more) as the angle you shot from gives this an uncomfortable lean.  Maybe a little too much in the foreground as well. 7 that I think could have been a 9 or 10 with a little more work in post.</td>', 'Great use of light and reflection.  Wish you did a touch of perspective correction (or a little more) as the angle you shot from gives this an uncomfortable lean.  Maybe a little too much in the foreground as well. 7 that I think could have been a 9 or 10 with a little more work in post.', '2014-11-06 06:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280855, 1134269, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the soft light with these colors.</td>', 'Love the soft light with these colors.', '2014-11-06 06:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280856, 1133941, 156466, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2014-11-06 06:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280857, 1134142, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the phrase on the sign, but i distracts from the pair speaking.  Too much of a good thing.</td>', 'Love the phrase on the sign, but i distracts from the pair speaking.  Too much of a good thing.', '2014-11-06 06:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280858, 1133069, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2014-11-06 06:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280859, 1134219, 156466, '<td valign="top">Alice feels a little too lost.  Not necessarily too small.  Maybe a square(r) crop brought in from the left?  Whether that''s running water or something else it just feels like noise pulling me away from her.</td>', 'Alice feels a little too lost.  Not necessarily too small.  Maybe a square(r) crop brought in from the left?  Whether that''s running water or something else it just feels like noise pulling me away from her.', '2014-11-06 06:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280861, 1132936, 156466, '<td valign="top">I got this immediately after the Emu shot and it made me chuckle. You''re just a hair too far too the right on an otherwise well done shot.</td>', 'I got this immediately after the Emu shot and it made me chuckle. You''re just a hair too far too the right on an otherwise well done shot.', '2014-11-06 06:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280862, 1133967, 156466, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and composition.  Nice use of Pringles lids(?)</td>', 'Interesting subject and composition.  Nice use of Pringles lids(?)', '2014-11-06 06:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280863, 1134002, 156466, '<td valign="top">Really lovely.  Perhaps a little more blur (i.e. less definition/structure) in the background to better accentuate these great old tree remnants.</td>', 'Really lovely.  Perhaps a little more blur (i.e. less definition/structure) in the background to better accentuate these great old tree remnants.', '2014-11-06 06:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280864, 1134264, 156466, '<td valign="top">Love the two on the left, and even the legs.  That other guy is nothing bu distracting from an otherwise lovely shot.</td>', 'Love the two on the left, and even the legs.  That other guy is nothing bu distracting from an otherwise lovely shot.', '2014-11-06 06:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280866, 1133665, 156466, '<td valign="top">This is so wonderful, but the skewed verticals on the walls are so distracting.  So easily fixable too. I''m still giving it a begrudging 8 because I love the ladies so much, but it could have been higher.</td>', 'This is so wonderful, but the skewed verticals on the walls are so distracting.  So easily fixable too. I''m still giving it a begrudging 8 because I love the ladies so much, but it could have been higher.', '2014-11-06 06:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280869, 1134145, 156466, '<td valign="top">Not quite - but pretty darn close.  Upper left corner needs pulling up just a touch to square the horizontal on that roof window.  If it wasn''t so close to the edge I might not notice (OK, I probably would).  Still, well seen and taken. 8</td>', 'Not quite - but pretty darn close.  Upper left corner needs pulling up just a touch to square the horizontal on that roof window.  If it wasn''t so close to the edge I might not notice (OK, I probably would).  Still, well seen and taken. 8', '2014-11-06 07:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
