(7280953, 1133742, 47974, '<td valign="top">Not sure what is wrong, something just seems off but I can not put my finger on it.  Maybe a little to dark?  Wish I could provide better feedback, if I have time will come back and see if I can nail down what is off to me.</td>', 'Not sure what is wrong, something just seems off but I can not put my finger on it.  Maybe a little to dark?  Wish I could provide better feedback, if I have time will come back and see if I can nail down what is off to me.', '2014-11-06 11:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
