(7280955, 1133803, 61396, '<td valign="top">well scoped</td>', 'well scoped', '2014-11-06 11:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280956, 1132936, 47974, '<td valign="top">You were slightly to the right when you took the photo, or that is how it seems to me.  Really love the image, just being a bit picky. Good job on getting it centered and love the sky.</td>', 'You were slightly to the right when you took the photo, or that is how it seems to me.  Really love the image, just being a bit picky. Good job on getting it centered and love the sky.', '2014-11-06 11:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280957, 1133659, 47974, '<td valign="top">Seems like you added the vignette to force attention to the train when maybe a better angle or composition would have been the better route.</td>', 'Seems like you added the vignette to force attention to the train when maybe a better angle or composition would have been the better route.', '2014-11-06 11:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280958, 1134167, 61396, '<td valign="top">you got it right</td>', 'you got it right', '2014-11-06 11:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280959, 1133714, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful environmental portrait and personally I love the subject.  To bad there is the modern water bottle and what I think is a box of matches.  There are also the modern sandals but I can deal with those more than the bottle.  I know you had no control over them.</td>', 'Wonderful environmental portrait and personally I love the subject.  To bad there is the modern water bottle and what I think is a box of matches.  There are also the modern sandals but I can deal with those more than the bottle.  I know you had no control over them.', '2014-11-06 11:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280960, 1134104, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and timing.  Just wish the trees were not there, would have looked so much better.</td>', 'Wonderful capture and timing.  Just wish the trees were not there, would have looked so much better.', '2014-11-06 11:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280962, 1133697, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really love how the light is falling down the alley and lighting the people on the left while the person on the right is in shadow.  Would have preferred a lower angle, for some reason I want to lower my head to get a lower perspective when looking at the photo.  Would have also liked a little more of the person to the right in the shot.  Them in shadow is perfect but being cut off is distracting to me.</td>', 'Really love how the light is falling down the alley and lighting the people on the left while the person on the right is in shadow.  Would have preferred a lower angle, for some reason I want to lower my head to get a lower perspective when looking at the photo.  Would have also liked a little more of the person to the right in the shot.  Them in shadow is perfect but being cut off is distracting to me.', '2014-11-06 11:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280964, 1133425, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image but the painter style processing is something I do not like.</td>', 'Wonderful image but the painter style processing is something I do not like.', '2014-11-06 11:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280966, 1133058, 47974, '<td valign="top">A different crop, taking some off from the right would have made a much stronger image.  Feel that the girl on the right is just a bit to centered for my taste.</td>', 'A different crop, taking some off from the right would have made a much stronger image.  Feel that the girl on the right is just a bit to centered for my taste.', '2014-11-06 11:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280967, 1133665, 47974, '<td valign="top">wonderful subjects.  I prefer my B&amp;W with a bit more contrast tho, image feels a bit washed out.</td>', 'wonderful subjects.  I prefer my B&W with a bit more contrast tho, image feels a bit washed out.', '2014-11-06 11:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280968, 1133749, 47974, '<td valign="top">Feel it would have been a stronger image if you had cropped out the sky above the bridge.  Having it there makes my eye wander up to the brighter area at the top.</td>', 'Feel it would have been a stronger image if you had cropped out the sky above the bridge.  Having it there makes my eye wander up to the brighter area at the top.', '2014-11-06 11:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280970, 1134165, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and subject.  My one bit of advice would be to brighten the area around the eye (Viveza from the NIK collection works great for this).  Living things need the eye to be clearly visible and in sharp focus to draw you in, well that is how I feel.  Overall the image is a little dark, enough to make you want it brighter but not enough to be a silhouette.</td>', 'Wonderful capture and subject.  My one bit of advice would be to brighten the area around the eye (Viveza from the NIK collection works great for this).  Living things need the eye to be clearly visible and in sharp focus to draw you in, well that is how I feel.  Overall the image is a little dark, enough to make you want it brighter but not enough to be a silhouette.', '2014-11-06 11:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280971, 1134263, 47974, '<td valign="top">This would have been a wonderful image and in my top choices if not for two things.  I can not decide which distracts more for me, the vignette or the boarder.  Either one of them ruin what could have been a wonderful image.</td>', 'This would have been a wonderful image and in my top choices if not for two things.  I can not decide which distracts more for me, the vignette or the boarder.  Either one of them ruin what could have been a wonderful image.', '2014-11-06 11:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280972, 1133857, 61396, '<td valign="top">I like the balance and I like the story, but most of all I like that figure</td>', 'I like the balance and I like the story, but most of all I like that figure', '2014-11-06 11:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280973, 1134096, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful B&amp;W portrait.</td>', 'Wonderful B&W portrait.', '2014-11-06 11:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280975, 1134110, 47974, '<td valign="top">Odd angle and border are distracting for me.</td>', 'Odd angle and border are distracting for me.', '2014-11-06 11:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280980, 1133856, 47974, '<td valign="top">Would have been a much stronger image if you were centered (when you took the photo) and you cropped out the sides and top</td>', 'Would have been a much stronger image if you were centered (when you took the photo) and you cropped out the sides and top', '2014-11-06 11:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280981, 1134041, 47974, '<td valign="top">Way overdone HDR or what ever processing you applied.</td>', 'Way overdone HDR or what ever processing you applied.', '2014-11-06 12:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280986, 1134246, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and processing.  One part that is odd for me and I can not figure out how are the eyes.  It looks as tho you were strait on when you took the photo but the eye on the right (his left eye) appears in focus, well the front part and it falls off very nicely.  The eye on the left seems a bit more out of focus.  Either way it is a wonderful image and just being picky.</td>', 'Wonderful capture and processing.  One part that is odd for me and I can not figure out how are the eyes.  It looks as tho you were strait on when you took the photo but the eye on the right (his left eye) appears in focus, well the front part and it falls off very nicely.  The eye on the left seems a bit more out of focus.  Either way it is a wonderful image and just being picky.', '2014-11-06 12:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7280988, 1134151, 47974, '<td valign="top">I have some similar shots but really prefer the eye open to being closed.</td>', 'I have some similar shots but really prefer the eye open to being closed.', '2014-11-06 12:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
