(7282053, 1132506, 67697, '<td valign="top">I have to say that it''s a shame this finished so low.  You captured a cute and candid moment.  I say continue to work with this type of style and the only thing i can tell you for now is to pay attention to what is in the background and try and avoid the clutter.  Create a balance between your subject and items behind her.<br/> <br/>She''s a cutie!</td>', 'I have to say that it''s a shame this finished so low.  You captured a cute and candid moment.  I say continue to work with this type of style and the only thing i can tell you for now is to pay attention to what is in the background and try and avoid the clutter.  Create a balance between your subject and items behind her. She''s a cutie!', '2014-11-08 00:22:29.000000', NULL, 0),
