(7282086, 1134196, 108580, '<td valign="top">Thoroughly enjoyed this with a 7. The bright leaf bottom left was a pity and hurt it overall. Some processing to darken it would have helped you a lot.</td>', 'Thoroughly enjoyed this with a 7. The bright leaf bottom left was a pity and hurt it overall. Some processing to darken it would have helped you a lot.', '2014-11-08 02:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282087, 1133855, 113411, '<td valign="top">Nikki this is sublime! I am so happy for you, it is a work of art. Congratulations!</td>', 'Nikki this is sublime! I am so happy for you, it is a work of art. Congratulations!', '2014-11-08 03:02:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282088, 1134225, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great image. Rewarded with a 7. Under-appreciated imho. Take a 2nd image at 30 seconds and blend (the water area) later to get the smooth effect you want and also running clouds. <br/>I have hit many 4th''s and 5ths (Honourable Mentions) in Free Studies due low ballers. Very annoying.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-11-08 03:03:11.</i></td>', 'Great image. Rewarded with a 7. Under-appreciated imho. Take a 2nd image at 30 seconds and blend (the water area) later to get the smooth effect you want and also running clouds. I have hit many 4th''s and 5ths (Honourable Mentions) in Free Studies due low ballers. Very annoying.', '2014-11-08 03:02:37.000000', '2014-11-08 03:03:11.000000', 0),
(7282089, 1133745, 108580, '<td valign="top">Under-appreciated imho. Avg (commenters): 7.1250! I know the feeling.</td>', 'Under-appreciated imho. Avg (commenters): 7.1250! I know the feeling.', '2014-11-08 03:04:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282090, 1134104, 108580, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 7. Great BiF. But the trees are distracting and especially so at homogeneous DPC.</td>', 'I gave it a 7. Great BiF. But the trees are distracting and especially so at homogeneous DPC.', '2014-11-08 03:05:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282091, 1134216, 118154, '<td valign="top">My comment is a complete surprise to me. Hope you enjoy it and it is helpful anyway.</td>', 'My comment is a complete surprise to me. Hope you enjoy it and it is helpful anyway.', '2014-11-08 03:06:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282093, 1134151, 108580, '<td valign="top">Under appreciated imho. Gave it a 7. An open eye with catch-light would have scored higher at DPC, even though the flamingo is obviously tucked in for a snooze! Reality in wildlife (or nature as this may be) is of little concern to non wildlife centric DPC voters. Be careful also with overcompressing the JPG, there are jaggies/artifacts developing in the fine feather details.</td>', 'Under appreciated imho. Gave it a 7. An open eye with catch-light would have scored higher at DPC, even though the flamingo is obviously tucked in for a snooze! Reality in wildlife (or nature as this may be) is of little concern to non wildlife centric DPC voters. Be careful also with overcompressing the JPG, there are jaggies/artifacts developing in the fine feather details.', '2014-11-08 03:08:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282094, 1134163, 135744, '<td valign="top">Well done on a super finish for a superb photo</td>', 'Well done on a super finish for a superb photo', '2014-11-08 03:09:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282096, 1133377, 108580, '<td valign="top">So there you had <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30364" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ubique</a> and <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/user_id/30861.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a> comments. What more could you ask for? I enjoyed it but it didn''t connect wrt DPC FS collective. In a specific challenge perhaps more so.</td>', 'So there you had  ubique and  Bear_Music comments. What more could you ask for? I enjoyed it but it didn''t connect wrt DPC FS collective. In a specific challenge perhaps more so.', '2014-11-08 03:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282098, 1134271, 108580, '<td valign="top">Connected with me. A socially current comment. 7.</td>', 'Connected with me. A socially current comment. 7.', '2014-11-08 03:12:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282101, 1133665, 108580, '<td valign="top">As always Clive I love what you do with those little mirror-less cameras. Do you own a DeLorean DMC-12? :) 7.<br/>Hear Hear:<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sacredspirit:</b></div><hr/><i> So it seems so expert.  I can''t believe that this is a 2014 shot, noway!  Your intentions are well executed, and this photo lends a high grade to the photographer skill set, more than the photo itself.  With that in mind, I''m not sure it wins the challenge, but it certainly wins my envy, and respect.  Amazing execution. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'As always Clive I love what you do with those little mirror-less cameras. Do you own a DeLorean DMC-12? :) 7.Hear Hear:Originally posted by sacredspirit: So it seems so expert.  I can''t believe that this is a 2014 shot, noway!  Your intentions are well executed, and this photo lends a high grade to the photographer skill set, more than the photo itself.  With that in mind, I''m not sure it wins the challenge, but it certainly wins my envy, and respect.  Amazing execution. ', '2014-11-08 03:15:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282102, 1132649, 135744, '<td valign="top">Arse! Well done sir!</td>', 'Arse! Well done sir!', '2014-11-08 03:16:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282104, 1134216, 108580, '<td valign="top">An under-appreciated image. I enjoyed it and had a suspicion it was yours. 7. Under arms are not loved by many and it''s a bold choice to portray it here at DPC. The deep blacks in the background offset her pale skin drawing focus to chest and arms and away from her shadowed face, this may be what kept it from scoring more Jo.</td>', 'An under-appreciated image. I enjoyed it and had a suspicion it was yours. 7. Under arms are not loved by many and it''s a bold choice to portray it here at DPC. The deep blacks in the background offset her pale skin drawing focus to chest and arms and away from her shadowed face, this may be what kept it from scoring more Jo.', '2014-11-08 03:20:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282105, 1133570, 108580, '<td valign="top">I liked the composition, reflection and fall colours, 7. A bit more contrast boost and possibly using the new 1200px format would have helped you.</td>', 'I liked the composition, reflection and fall colours, 7. A bit more contrast boost and possibly using the new 1200px format would have helped you.', '2014-11-08 03:21:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282107, 1134111, 108580, '<td valign="top">I''m glad to see that you''ve stepped out of your "box" with this image. When you do so (with an emotional and connecting work) yet it scores low here at DPC it hurts, but it''s a powerful image and you should canvas it and hang it in the foyer for others to enjoy.</td>', 'I''m glad to see that you''ve stepped out of your "box" with this image. When you do so (with an emotional and connecting work) yet it scores low here at DPC it hurts, but it''s a powerful image and you should canvas it and hang it in the foyer for others to enjoy.', '2014-11-08 03:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282108, 1134103, 67258, '<td valign="top">A 7 from me - but it does look very bright on my, admittedly uncallibrated, laptop screen.</td>', 'A 7 from me - but it does look very bright on my, admittedly uncallibrated, laptop screen.', '2014-11-08 03:24:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282109, 1133011, 108580, '<td valign="top">Few people have the skills to capture a great vibrant portrait such as this. Don''t be disheartened by their 2''s, 3''s and 4''s. Keep shooting. 7 from me.</td>', 'Few people have the skills to capture a great vibrant portrait such as this. Don''t be disheartened by their 2''s, 3''s and 4''s. Keep shooting. 7 from me.', '2014-11-08 03:26:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282110, 1133818, 108580, '<td valign="top">Looks like everyone is "online" :) Naturally a 7 from me.</td>', 'Looks like everyone is "online" :) Naturally a 7 from me.', '2014-11-08 03:27:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282111, 1134118, 108580, '<td valign="top">7 from me. U/E IMHO.</td>', '7 from me. U/E IMHO.', '2014-11-08 03:28:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282112, 1132187, 108580, '<td valign="top">7. U/E IMHO.</td>', '7. U/E IMHO.', '2014-11-08 03:28:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282114, 1134247, 108580, '<td valign="top">A bold fungus with tight dof. 7. One day they may learn to vote higher on the less mainstream work...</td>', 'A bold fungus with tight dof. 7. One day they may learn to vote higher on the less mainstream work...', '2014-11-08 03:30:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282116, 1134142, 108580, '<td valign="top">All of the above :) 7.</td>', 'All of the above :) 7.', '2014-11-08 03:31:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282118, 1133847, 108580, '<td valign="top">Reminds me very much of my days in Australia. A colourful 7.</td>', 'Reminds me very much of my days in Australia. A colourful 7.', '2014-11-08 03:35:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282119, 1133855, 108580, '<td valign="top">I''m also thrilled this won Nikki. Hill gradations are one of my favourite genres as shown with my 10. There''s hope yet for simple and elegant scapes here.</td>', 'I''m also thrilled this won Nikki. Hill gradations are one of my favourite genres as shown with my 10. There''s hope yet for simple and elegant scapes here.', '2014-11-08 03:38:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282120, 1134117, 108580, '<td valign="top">A magical wonderland. WD on your ribbon. 7</td>', 'A magical wonderland. WD on your ribbon. 7', '2014-11-08 03:38:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282121, 1132649, 108580, '<td valign="top">Indeed a victory for your style of work. Congrats.</td>', 'Indeed a victory for your style of work. Congrats.', '2014-11-08 03:39:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282124, 1134152, 108580, '<td valign="top">Remembrances. The sanctity of memory. I gave it a nostalgic 6. A 7 if the suit had a wee bit more detail in it simply because he and his uniform bind the story Herman.</td>', 'Remembrances. The sanctity of memory. I gave it a nostalgic 6. A 7 if the suit had a wee bit more detail in it simply because he and his uniform bind the story Herman.', '2014-11-08 03:52:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282125, 1133794, 108580, '<td valign="top">The processing adds mystery and intrigue. 7.</td>', 'The processing adds mystery and intrigue. 7.', '2014-11-08 03:54:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282127, 1133284, 108580, '<td valign="top">Only train lovers would feel the love like I did. 7.</td>', 'Only train lovers would feel the love like I did. 7.', '2014-11-08 03:57:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282128, 1134155, 108580, '<td valign="top">Got the love from me Gina. 7.</td>', 'Got the love from me Gina. 7.', '2014-11-08 04:00:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282143, 1133227, 20799, '<td valign="top">Well done, Anita. I love the joyous-red flying shoe lace!</td>', 'Well done, Anita. I love the joyous-red flying shoe lace!', '2014-11-08 04:43:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282144, 1134025, 20799, '<td valign="top">Wow. How did I miss this. Very cool, congrats on the Thumb!</td>', 'Wow. How did I miss this. Very cool, congrats on the Thumb!', '2014-11-08 04:44:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282148, 1134002, 20799, '<td valign="top">An 8 from me, very interesting and fantastic light. Loved it.</td>', 'An 8 from me, very interesting and fantastic light. Loved it.', '2014-11-08 04:58:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282149, 1132649, 21714, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a non-photographer.</td>', 'Not bad for a non-photographer.', '2014-11-08 04:59:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282150, 1133760, 81362, '<td valign="top">My eye would rank this much higher. Not only good documentary image of the critter, but also interesting expression, good use of light, exemplary composition, and title conveying good advice to photographers as well as lizards. If B&amp;W images could be ranked separately from the others, this image would be 17th instead of 67th. Yeah, maybe that''s what we need.</td>', 'My eye would rank this much higher. Not only good documentary image of the critter, but also interesting expression, good use of light, exemplary composition, and title conveying good advice to photographers as well as lizards. If B&W images could be ranked separately from the others, this image would be 17th instead of 67th. Yeah, maybe that''s what we need.', '2014-11-08 05:01:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282151, 1133377, 20799, '<td valign="top">So unique I knew this was from my fellow aviation enthusiast colleague :-). Wish I could see this elegant beast up close one day. Gave this a 9 btw.</td>', 'So unique I knew this was from my fellow aviation enthusiast colleague :-). Wish I could see this elegant beast up close one day. Gave this a 9 btw.', '2014-11-08 05:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282153, 1132186, 20799, '<td valign="top">Well it finished higher than expected :-). Great panning shot.</td>', 'Well it finished higher than expected :-). Great panning shot.', '2014-11-08 05:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282156, 1133832, 81362, '<td valign="top">Same visual "fishing hole" as your recent red ribbon entry? That both of your color/form/ambiguous/semi-abstract images are in top 20 in these challenges seriously undermines the accusations that he majority of DPC voters only like sharp traditional eye-candy representational images. (Hope this observation doesn''t diminish the special sub-culture group feeling for those who, like me, appreciate such images.) Love that you got this one with an iPhone!</td>', 'Same visual "fishing hole" as your recent red ribbon entry? That both of your color/form/ambiguous/semi-abstract images are in top 20 in these challenges seriously undermines the accusations that he majority of DPC voters only like sharp traditional eye-candy representational images. (Hope this observation doesn''t diminish the special sub-culture group feeling for those who, like me, appreciate such images.) Love that you got this one with an iPhone!', '2014-11-08 05:12:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282158, 1134212, 20799, '<td valign="top">I gave this two 5s :-).</td>', 'I gave this two 5s :-).', '2014-11-08 05:24:08.000000', NULL, 0);
