(7282201, 1134167, 82707, '<td valign="top">Great portrait!  ..and I get the reference... being an Aussie!   :)</td>', 'Great portrait!  ..and I get the reference... being an Aussie!   :)', '2014-11-08 08:26:56.000000', NULL, 0),
