(7282205, 1134147, 30364, '<td valign="top">Fuji should be paying you for owning that X100S.  I know the Leica guys here admire your X100s stuff, and you deserve to be in their company.  Or they in yours.  It''s beautiful, durable craftsmanship, Mark.  I think your stuff is consistently what poker players refer to as ''the nuts''.  Thank you.</td>', 'Fuji should be paying you for owning that X100S.  I know the Leica guys here admire your X100s stuff, and you deserve to be in their company.  Or they in yours.  It''s beautiful, durable craftsmanship, Mark.  I think your stuff is consistently what poker players refer to as ''the nuts''.  Thank you.', '2014-11-08 08:44:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282206, 1132649, 54446, '<td valign="top">Front page, ribbon shot of an elephant''s posterior, center-middle composition with heavy dark vignette on the edges.  Wow!  Congratulations on your ribbon.  It''s a masterpiece!</td>', 'Front page, ribbon shot of an elephant''s posterior, center-middle composition with heavy dark vignette on the edges.  Wow!  Congratulations on your ribbon.  It''s a masterpiece!', '2014-11-08 08:45:48.000000', NULL, 0),
