(7282226, 1134096, 138630, '<td valign="top">Terrific lighting - I think he looks like a young man who is quite comfortable in his skin and will go far.  Well done on your part, too.  Congratulations on the top 10.</td>', 'Terrific lighting - I think he looks like a young man who is quite comfortable in his skin and will go far.  Well done on your part, too.  Congratulations on the top 10.', '2014-11-08 09:59:45.000000', NULL, 0),
