(7282279, 1134264, 124815, '<td valign="top">What fascinated me here was the invisible geometry made my the directions and intersections of the gaze of the people, including the one whose head we don''t see. <br/>We guess that what they look at is quite long and a bit unusual, perhaps just a sunset that stopped them all; the man in the background seems to observe the little girl but there is a sense of expectation and of suspense that won me. Perhaps it''s the dark sun; as if they expect a solar eclipse. <br/>To me this was the best FS.<br/>I like the color shot also but I prefer the B&amp;W</td>', 'What fascinated me here was the invisible geometry made my the directions and intersections of the gaze of the people, including the one whose head we don''t see. We guess that what they look at is quite long and a bit unusual, perhaps just a sunset that stopped them all; the man in the background seems to observe the little girl but there is a sense of expectation and of suspense that won me. Perhaps it''s the dark sun; as if they expect a solar eclipse. To me this was the best FS.I like the color shot also but I prefer the B&W', '2014-11-08 11:12:20.000000', NULL, 0),
