(7282639, 1134029, 30049, '<td valign="top">Another thing that strikes me on this photo is "breaking the rule" here works.  Generally, at least the way I''ve learned it, is you don''t want your subject running out of the frame.  Here, the boat is exiting fast!  :-)  But it works.  I think the diagonal line of the wake is also helpful.  If this was shot where the boat was moving horizontal to you I don''t think it would have the same impact.</td>', 'Another thing that strikes me on this photo is "breaking the rule" here works.  Generally, at least the way I''ve learned it, is you don''t want your subject running out of the frame.  Here, the boat is exiting fast!  :-)  But it works.  I think the diagonal line of the wake is also helpful.  If this was shot where the boat was moving horizontal to you I don''t think it would have the same impact.', '2014-11-09 08:46:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7282664, 1132649, 50864, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on another wonderful photograph. It''s great to see one of yours on the front page. But it''s always great to see one of yours. On any page.</td>', 'Congratulations on another wonderful photograph. It''s great to see one of yours on the front page. But it''s always great to see one of yours. On any page.', '2014-11-09 09:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
