(7284629, 1134225, 24073, '<td valign="top">I also noticed the 1''s voted into the challenge.  Not only on my own shots, but I went through looking at some of the top shots.  There is not an answer that I could come up with, yes I agree, this shot taking two 1''s is pretty ridiculous, more than ridiculous. Ridiculous in my opinion for this shot is anything under 5, which your shot is even better- than that, but 1, and even the 3 just doesn''t make sense unless the motive of such is defined.  You know what I''m saying?<br/> <br/>BTW, I gave it a nine.  Keep your head up, you are doing a fine job.</td>', 'I also noticed the 1''s voted into the challenge.  Not only on my own shots, but I went through looking at some of the top shots.  There is not an answer that I could come up with, yes I agree, this shot taking two 1''s is pretty ridiculous, more than ridiculous. Ridiculous in my opinion for this shot is anything under 5, which your shot is even better- than that, but 1, and even the 3 just doesn''t make sense unless the motive of such is defined.  You know what I''m saying? BTW, I gave it a nine.  Keep your head up, you are doing a fine job.', '2014-11-12 07:44:50.000000', NULL, 0),
